## WF-1: Login Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CA as Core App
    participant DE as Detection Engine
    participant CDB as core-db

    U->>CA: POST /api/v1/auth/login<br/>(username, password)
    CA->>CDB: SELECT user WHERE username
    CDB-->>CA: user record (hash, status, mfa settings)

    alt credentials INVALID
        CA->>CDB: INSERT login_attempt (outcome=failure)
        CA-->>U: 401 Invalid credentials
    else account LOCKED/SUSPENDED
        CA->>CDB: INSERT login_attempt (outcome=locked)
        CA-->>U: 423 Account locked
    else credentials VALID
        Note over CA,DE: Risk gate (2026-10-05)<br/>đồng bộ, timeout 3s, FAIL OPEN
        CA->>DE: POST /internal/pre-token-check<br/>(username, user_id, ip, ua)
        DE-->>CA: {risk_level, require_mfa, degraded}

        alt require_mfa (high / critical)
            CA->>CDB: INSERT login_attempt (outcome=mfa_required)
            CA->>CDB: INSERT mfa_transactions (status=pending)
            Note over CA: Chưa tạo session,<br/>chưa cấp token
            CA-->>U: 200 {mfa_required: true}
        else low / medium / degraded
            CA->>CDB: INSERT login_attempt (outcome=success)
            CA->>CDB: INSERT sessions (token_jti, expires_at)
            CA-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
        end
    end

    U->>CA: POST /api/v1/auth/mfa/verify<br/>(transaction_id, code)
    CA->>CDB: SELECT mfa_transactions WHERE id
    CDB-->>CA: transaction record

    alt code INVALID
        CA->>CDB: UPDATE mfa_transactions (status=failed)
        CA-->>U: 401 MFA failed
    else code VALID
        CA->>CDB: UPDATE mfa_transactions (status=completed)
        CA->>CDB: INSERT sessions
        CA-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    end

    Note over CA,CDB: **Sau khi login thành công:**<br/>CA INSERT login_attempts rồi POST thẳng<br/>sang Detection (chưa dùng outbox)
```

