## WF-2: Detection Engine Flow (Risk Gate + Direct HTTP)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant CA as Core App
    participant CDB as core-db
    participant DE as Detection Engine
    participant DDB as detection-db
    participant ML as ML Service
    participant MDB as ml-service-db

    Note over CA,DE: Phase 0 - Risk gate<br/>dong bo, timeout 3s, FAIL OPEN
    CA->>DE: POST /api/v1/internal/pre-token-check<br/>(username, user_id, ip, ua)
    DE-->>CA: {risk_level, require_mfa, degraded}
    Note over CA: high/critical - giu token, bat MFA<br/>low/medium - cap token<br/>loi - cho qua

    Note over CA,CDB: Phase 1 - Login event gui truc tiep<br/>KHONG qua outbox (chua hien thuc)
    CA->>CDB: INSERT login_attempts
    CA->>DE: POST /api/v1/internal/login-events<br/>(event_id, user_id, ip, ua, ...)<br/>+ Internal-Secret
    DE->>DDB: INSERT login_attempts<br/>(event_id, ..., status=pending)
    DE-->>CA: 202 Accepted {login_attempt_id}

    Note over DE,DDB: Phase 2 - Detection pipeline<br/>chay await trong handler, KHONG co worker nen
    loop ngay trong handler
        DE->>DE: Calculate rule_score
        DE->>DDB: INSERT detection_logs (stage=rule_evaluation)

        DE->>ML: POST /api/v1/internal/ml/score<br/>(features_vector)
        ML->>MDB: SELECT active model
        ML->>ML: IsolationForest.predict()
        ML->>MDB: INSERT inference_logs
        ML-->>DE: {anomaly_score, is_anomaly, reason_codes}

        DE->>DE: combined = 0.4 x rule + 0.6 x ml
        DE->>DDB: INSERT risk_assessments
        DE->>DDB: UPDATE login_attempts (status=processed)

        alt risk_level HIGH/CRITICAL
            DE->>DDB: INSERT alerts (status=open)
            DE->>DDB: INSERT detection_logs (stage=action_sent)
        else LOW/MEDIUM
            DE->>DDB: INSERT detection_logs (no_alert)
        end

        Note over DE,CA: Gui action SAU khi commit<br/>timeout 3s, nuot loi
        alt risk_level = HIGH
            DE->>CA: POST /api/v1/internal/actions<br/>(action=REQUIRE_MFA, idempotency_key)
            CA->>CDB: UPDATE users (detection_mfa_once=true)
            CA->>CDB: UPDATE sessions (revoked_at=NOW())
            CA-->>DE: 200 {details.sessions_revoked}
        else risk_level = CRITICAL
            DE->>CA: POST /api/v1/internal/actions<br/>(action=REVOKE_SESSIONS, idempotency_key)
            CA->>CDB: UPDATE sessions (revoked_at=NOW())
            CA-->>DE: 200 {details.sessions_revoked}
        end
    end
```

