## WF-3: SOC Alert Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as SOC Analyst
    participant CA as Core App
    participant DE as Detection Engine
    participant DDB as detection-db
    participant CDB as core-db

    S->>CA: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    CA-->>S: 200 {access_token, role=SOC_ANALYST}

    S->>DE: GET /api/v1/alerts<br/>?status=open&risk_level=high<br/>+ Bearer {token}
    DE->>DE: validate opaque bearer token → Session → User → Roles
    DE->>DDB: SELECT alerts WHERE filters
    DDB-->>DE: [alerts]
    DE-->>S: 200 {alerts: [...]}

    S->>DE: GET /api/v1/alerts/{id}
    DE->>DDB: SELECT alerts JOIN login_attempts JOIN risk_assessments
    DDB-->>DE: alert detail
    DE-->>S: 200 {alert, login_attempt, risk_assessment}

    alt Acknowledge
        S->>DE: PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}<br/>{status: "acknowledged"}
        DE->>CDB: (HTTP) validate SOC analyst
        DE->>DDB: UPDATE alerts (status=acknowledged, assigned_to)
        DE->>DDB: INSERT alert_timeline (event_type=acknowledged)
        DE-->>S: 200 {alert: acknowledged}
    else Resolve
        S->>DE: PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}<br/>{status: "resolved", resolution}
        DE->>DDB: UPDATE alerts (status=resolved, resolved_by, resolved_at)
        DE->>DDB: INSERT alert_timeline (event_type=resolved)
        DE-->>S: 200 {alert: resolved}
    else False Positive
        S->>DE: PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}<br/>{status: "false_positive"}
        DE->>DDB: UPDATE alerts (status=false_positive)
        DE->>DDB: INSERT alert_timeline
        DE-->>S: 200 {alert: false_positive}
    end

    Note over S,DE: Alert State Machine:<br/>open → acknowledged → resolved<br/>            ↘ false_positive
```

