## WF-4: MFA Flow - Chi tiết

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CA as Core App
    participant N as Notification Service
    participant CDB as core-db

    Note over U,CDB: **MFA Trigger:**<br/>1. Login + MFA enabled<br/>2. Risk HIGH/CRITICAL<br/>3. Sensitive operation<br/>4. Periodic re-auth

    CA->>CDB: INSERT mfa_transactions (status=pending)

    alt MFA via EMAIL
        CA->>N: Send OTP via Email
        N-->>CA: notification_id
        CA->>CDB: INSERT mfa_notifications (channel=email)
        CA-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: email_otp, expires_in: 300}
        U->>CA: POST /mfa/verify (code: "123456")

    else MFA via SMS
        CA->>N: Send OTP via SMS
        CA-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: sms_otp, expires_in: 300}
        U->>CA: POST /mfa/verify (code)

    else MFA via TOTP
        CA-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: totp}
        Note over U: Google Authenticator
        U->>CA: POST /mfa/verify (code)

    else MFA via PUSH
        CA->>N: Send Push
        CA-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: push, expires_in: 120}
        U->>CA: POST /mfa/verify (action: approve)
    end

    CA->>CDB: SELECT mfa_transactions WHERE id
    CDB-->>CA: transaction record

    alt Invalid/Expired/IP mismatch
        CA->>CDB: UPDATE (status=failed, fail_count+1)
        alt fail_count >= 3
            CA->>CDB: UPDATE users (status=locked)
            CA-->>U: 403 ACCOUNT_LOCKED
        else
            CA-->>U: 401 MFA_FAILED
        end
    else Valid/Approved
        CA->>CDB: UPDATE (status=completed)
        CA-->>U: 200 OK {mfa_verified: true}
    end

    opt Trust Device
        U->>CA: POST /mfa/trust-device {fingerprint}
        CA->>CDB: INSERT user_trusted_devices
        CA-->>U: 200 {trusted: true, expires_at: +30d}
    end
```

