## WF-5: Session Management

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CA as Core App
    participant CDB as core-db

    Note over U,CDB: Session được tạo sau:<br/>1. Login thành công<br/>2. MFA verify thành công

    CA->>CDB: INSERT sessions<br/>(token_jti, access_hash, refresh_hash,<br/>expires_at=NOW()+1h)
    CA-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    Note over U,CDB: access_token expiry = 1h (v3.3 prototype)<br/>refresh_token: unlimited until revoked<br/>P1-F: concurrent refresh hardening — IMPLEMENTATION BACKLOG

    Note over U,CA: Token Refresh
    U->>CA: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (refresh_token)
    CA->>CDB: SELECT sessions WHERE refresh_token_hash
    alt valid + not revoked
        CA->>CDB: UPDATE sessions (new token_jti, expires_at)
        CA-->>U: 200 {access_token}
    else expired/revoked
        CA-->>U: 401 TOKEN_EXPIRED
    end

    Note over U,CA: Logout Single
    U->>CA: POST /api/v1/auth/logout
    CA->>CDB: UPDATE sessions (revoked_at=NOW())
    CA->>CDB: INSERT audit_logs (action=logout)
    CA-->>U: 200 {logged_out: true}

    Note over U,CA: Logout All
    U->>CA: POST /api/v1/auth/logout-all
    CA->>CDB: UPDATE sessions WHERE user_id (revoked_at)
    CA-->>U: 200 {logged_out_all: true, sessions_revoked: N}

    Note over U,CA: List Sessions
    U->>CA: GET /api/v1/sessions
    CA->>CDB: SELECT sessions WHERE user_id AND revoked_at IS NULL
    CA-->>U: 200 {sessions: [...]}

    Note over U,CA: Admin Revoke
    U->>CA: POST /api/v1/admin/sessions/{id}/revoke (admin_token)
    CA->>CA: validate opaque bearer token → Session → User → Roles
    CA->>CDB: UPDATE sessions (revoked_at)
    CA->>CDB: INSERT audit_logs (action=session_revoked_by_admin)
    CA-->>U: 200 {revoked: true}
```

