## WF-6: ML Inference Flow (MỚI trong v3.3)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant DE as Detection Engine
    participant ML as ML Service
    participant MDB as ml-service-db
    participant MOD as Model File

    Note over DE,ML: Trigger từ WF-2<br/>(trong detection pipeline)

    DE->>ML: GET /api/v1/internal/ml/health
    ML-->>DE: 200 {model_status: ready, version}

    alt ML DOWN
        DE->>DE: ml_status=error → fallback rule-only
    else ML UP
        DE->>ML: POST /api/v1/internal/ml/score<br/>(features: {6_features})
        activate ML
        ML->>MDB: SELECT active model_version
        ML->>MOD: Load isolation-forest-v1.0.joblib

        alt inference SUCCESS
            ML->>ML: predict() → raw_score, is_anomaly
            ML->>MDB: INSERT inference_logs
            ML-->>DE: 200 {normalized_anomaly_score, is_anomaly,<br/>reason_codes, model_version, model_status}
        else TIMEOUT (>5s)
            ML->>MDB: INSERT inference_logs (status=degraded)
            ML-->>DE: 408 Timeout {ml_status: timeout}
        else ERROR
            ML->>MDB: INSERT inference_logs (status=error)
            ML-->>DE: 500 Error {ml_status: error}
        end
        deactivate ML
    end

    Note over ML,MDB: Background:<br/>Hourly feature statistics
    ML->>MDB: INSERT feature_statistics<br/>(count, mean, std, p25..p95)
```

