## Bảng tổng hợp Workflows (v3.3)

| ID | Tên | Service | Mô tả | Actors |
|----|-----|---------|--------|--------|
| WF-1 | Login Flow | core-app | Login + MFA verification | User |
| WF-2 | Detection Engine | detection-engine | Async detection pipeline (outbox + HTTP) | System |
| WF-3 | SOC Alert | detection-engine | View và xử lý alerts | SOC Analyst |
| WF-4 | MFA Flow | core-app | Chi tiết 4 loại MFA (email/sms/totp/push) | User |
| WF-5 | Session Management | core-app | Login, logout, refresh, admin revoke | User/Admin |
| WF-6 | ML Inference | ml-service | Risk scoring bằng Isolation Forest | Detection |

