## Liên kết với Database Schema (v3.3)

| Workflow | Tables sử dụng | Database |
|----------|----------------|----------|
| WF-1 | users, sessions, mfa_transactions, mfa_notifications, login_attempts | core-db |
| WF-2 | login_attempts, risk_assessments, detection_logs, alerts | detection-db (nhận trực tiếp qua HTTP; outbox_events chưa dùng) |
| WF-3 | alerts, alert_timeline, soc_analysts, login_attempts | detection-db (+ cross-ref core-db) |
| WF-4 | mfa_transactions, mfa_notifications, user_trusted_devices, users | core-db |
| WF-5 | sessions, audit_logs, users | core-db |
| WF-6 | model_versions, inference_logs, feature_statistics | ml-service-db |
